        <p class="animals-directory-note">The contact list is preserved from UnPoison’s January 2026 PDF. Numbers and availability may change; your nearest vet or local SPCA can help if a listed contact is unreachable. UnPoison is not an emergency veterinary service.</p>
      </div>
